ce your teammates, and you’ll need to manage your limited inventory smartly. The game is a lot of fun! As true iKun, we respect our brother more than anyone else in the world and stand by him through all the gossip — don’t even ask where the rumors come from! Play it now!”<br>推荐 – 游戏高手鉴赏组<br><br>“A multiplayer online chaotic puzzle escape game supporting up to 4 players in a room. Presented in 3D scenes as terrifying dreamscapes, you must escape nightmares filled with various absurd creatures. Use cabinets or your teammates to distract these beings while solving puzzles. The seemingly horror-themed environments are sprinkled with internet memes. Find items and hidden clues, decipher mechanisms, and always manage your anxiety level. Remember: don’t stare at the chaotic beings for too long. Make good use of &quot;Lao Da Drink&quot; to strengthen yourself. Ultimately, there are dual endings—will you be an &quot;iKun&quot; or a &quot;hater&quot;? Check out the achievements and decide.”<br>推荐 – 鱼汤里的咸鱼<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/header.jpg?t=1771774892", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/af5d090dc857c8018a49035e30dffcde5020e248/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771774892", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808570/af5d090dc857c8018a49035e30dffcde5020e248/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771774892", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 4GB / AMD RX 550 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><